# ${name} -- Flask onboarding wizard

Scaffolded by `xsm new --template flask` from the
[`flask_wizard` example](https://github.com/basiltt/xstate-statemachine/tree/main/examples/integrations/flask_wizard):
a 4-step wizard where NEXT / BACK / SUBMIT are statechart events, one
machine per browser session.

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt     # add flask-wtf for CSRF protection
flask --app app run                 # http://127.0.0.1:5000/
WIZARD_STORE=sqlite flask --app app run
WIZARD_STORE=sqlalchemy flask --app app run   # needs xstate-statemachine[sqlalchemy]
flask --app app xsm inspect wizard
python -m pytest tests -q
```

Edit `machine.json` (the chart) and the actions/guards in `app.py`.